# Apps+lsft (actions/actions_apps.kbd)
**apps + lsft + 0** -- Firefox Misc
**apps + lsft + 1** -- Firefox Mgmt
**apps + lsft + 2** -- Firefox Cloud
**apps + lsft + 3** -- Firefox Ai
**apps + lsft + 4** -- Firefox Banks
**apps + lsft + 5** -- Firefox Misc
**apps + lsft + 9** -- Firefox Colab
**apps + lsft + f** -- Fusion360
**apps + lsft + k** -- Okular
**apps + lsft + o** -- Onlyoffice
**apps + lsft + t** -- Telegram
